---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../components/Breadcrumb.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service — AnimeCharactersList"
  description="Read the official Terms of Service of AnimeCharactersList.com. Learn about website usage, intellectual property, and fan directory disclaimers."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-6">
    <!-- Breadcrumb -->
    <Breadcrumb items={[{ label: 'Terms of Service' }]} />

    <div class="text-left mb-8">
      <h1 class="text-text-primary text-3xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-none mb-3">
        Terms of <span class="gradient-text font-black">Service</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm md:text-base">
        Last updated: August 9, 2026
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="card p-6 md:p-8 bg-bg-secondary border border-border-default rounded-2xl space-y-6 text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">1. Agreement to Terms</h2>
      <p>
        By accessing our website at AnimeCharactersList.com, you are agreeing to be bound by these terms of service, all applicable laws and regulations, and agree that you are responsible for compliance with any applicable local laws. If you do not agree with any of these terms, you are prohibited from using or accessing this site.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">2. Use License</h2>
      <p>
        Permission is granted to temporarily download one copy of the materials (information or software) on AnimeCharactersList.com's website for personal, non-commercial transitory viewing only. This is the grant of a license, not a transfer of title, and under this license you may not modify or copy the materials, use the materials for any commercial purpose, or attempt to decompile any software contained on the site.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">3. Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>
        The materials on AnimeCharactersList.com's website are provided on an 'as is' basis. AnimeCharactersList.com makes no warranties, expressed or implied, and hereby disclaims and negates all other warranties including, without limitation, implied warranties or conditions of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, or non-infringement of intellectual property or other violation of rights.
      </p>
      <p>
        Further, AnimeCharactersList.com does not warrant or make any representations concerning the accuracy, likely results, or reliability of the use of the materials on its website or otherwise relating to such materials or on any sites linked to this site.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">4. Limitations of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        In no event shall AnimeCharactersList.com or its suppliers be liable for any damages (including, without limitation, damages for loss of data or profit, or due to business interruption) arising out of the use or inability to use the materials on AnimeCharactersList.com's website, even if AnimeCharactersList.com or a authorized representative has been notified orally or in writing of the possibility of such damage.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">5. Intellectual Property & Fan Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>
        AnimeCharactersList.com is a fan-created informational directory. All anime characters, names, cover arts, and related franchise symbols are properties of their respective copyright holders, authors, and animation production studios. All stats and power levels displayed on this site are estimates calculated for entertainment purposes only.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
